    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just... constant. even when i'm sleeping, it feels like i'm still just running on that same broken loop. you said i should just let myself rest. but even rest feels like it's part of the cycle in this city. is there ever actually a way to just... be still? like, truly still?",
